{"id":764,"date":"2021-03-13T13:12:40","date_gmt":"2021-03-13T13:12:40","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/?post_type=person&#038;p=764"},"modified":"2025-11-01T15:00:33","modified_gmt":"2025-11-01T15:00:33","slug":"seyram-kelvin-anku-etu","status":"publish","type":"person","link":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/person\/seyram-kelvin-anku-etu\/","title":{"rendered":"Seyram Kelvin Anku-Etu"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover profile-banner bg-alt\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-100 has-background-dim\" style=\"background-color:none\"><\/span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\">\n\n\n<a href=\"javascript:history.back()\"> <div class=\"profiles-btn\"> \n\n<div class=\"btn-left-sq bg-primary\"> <i class=\"fa fa-caret-left white-text\"> <\/i> <\/div>\n<div class=\"btn-text title-bold white-text\">Back to Profiles<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/a>\n\n<h2 class=\"profile-name\">Seyram Kelvin Anku-Etu<\/h2>\n\n<ul class=\"profile-list prof-pos\" style=\"list-style:none;\"><li class=\"profile-position\">IT Manager<\/li><\/ul>\n\n<p class=\"profile-info profile-tagline primary-bold prof-pos\"><span class=\"primary-text is-bold\"><\/span><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-group pad-5 profile-body\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/03\/Seyram1-scaled-1.jpg\"\/>\n\n\n<p>Seyram Kelvin Anku-Etu is a graduate of the Regional Maritime University \u2013 Ghana.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>He is CISCO certified and his experience spins around management of Server Infrastructures and Data-Center operations across platforms (Unix, Linux and Windows), Network and System Administration, Cyber Security and Vulnerability Assessment.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Prior to joining AIMS Ghana, he worked with RPS Engineering Services as a Field Engineer and the National Lottery Authority as the Systems Administrator.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>As the IT Manager, he is committed to delivering his optimum best to make AIMS-Ghana an excellent environment for both students and staff.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Seyram Kelvin Anku-Etu is a graduate of the Regional Maritime University \u2013 Ghana. He is CISCO certified and his experience spins around management of Server Infrastructures and Data-Center operations across platforms (Unix, Linux and Windows), Network and System Administration, Cyber Security and Vulnerability Assessment. Prior to joining AIMS Ghana, he worked with RPS Engineering Services<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":13160,"parent":0,"template":"","meta":{"advgb_blocks_editor_width":"","advgb_blocks_columns_visual_guide":"","profile-name":"Seyram Kelvin Anku-Etu","profile-position":"IT Manager","profile-tagline":""},"tags":[],"people_types":[12],"acf":[],"featured_img":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/03\/Seyram1-scaled-1.jpg","coauthors":[],"author_meta":{"author_link":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/author\/rose\/","display_name":"rose"},"relative_dates":{"created":"Posted 5 years ago","modified":"Updated 3 weeks ago"},"absolute_dates":{"created":"Posted on March 13, 2021","modified":"Updated on November 1, 2025"},"absolute_dates_time":{"created":"Posted on March 13, 2021 1:12 pm","modified":"Updated on November 1, 2025 3:00 pm"},"featured_img_caption":"","tax_additional":{"post_tag":{"linked":[],"unlinked":[],"slug":"post_tag","name":"Tags"},"people_types":{"linked":["<a href=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/person_type\/management\/\" class=\"advgb-post-tax-term\">Management<\/a>"],"unlinked":["<span class=\"advgb-post-tax-term\">Management<\/span>"],"slug":"people_types","name":"Person Type"}},"series_order":"","_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/person\/764"}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/person"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/aims.edu.g